msgstr ""
"<guimenu>क्रीडा</guimenu> <guimenuitem>खेलेन सह सम्बद्धं "
"कुर्वन्तु…</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:292
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Connect to a server to start a game."
msgstr "क्रीडां आरभ्य सर्वरेण सह सम्बद्धं कुर्वन्तु ।"

#: index.docbook:299
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>प्रश्न</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>निर्गम</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:308
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Exit</action> &i18n-knavalbattle;."
msgstr "<action>निर्गम</action> &i18n-knavalbattle;।"

#: index.docbook:316
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Change Nickname…</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>उपनाम परिवर्तयतु…</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:323
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change the default nickname."
msgstr "पूर्वनिर्धारितं उपनाम परिवर्तयन्तु ।"

#: index.docbook:330
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Play Sounds</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>ध्वनयः वादयन्तु</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:336
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Toggle whether sounds (played when shooting) should be "
"played.</action> The default is on."
msgstr ""
"<action>ध्वनयः (शूटिंग् करणसमये वाद्यन्ते) वादयितव्याः वा इति टॉग्ल् "
"कुर्वन्तु ।</action> पूर्वनिर्धारितं चालू अस्ति ।"

#: index.docbook:345
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Adjacent Ships</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>समीपस्थानि जहाजानि</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:351
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Toggle whether the ships can be put on a desk without one empty "
"space between them.</action> The default is on. This setting should be "
"defined on a host when <link linkend=\"howtoplay\">playing "
"&i18n-knavalbattle; via network</link>."
msgstr ""
"<action>जहाजाः तयोः मध्ये एकं रिक्तस्थानं विना मेजस्य उपरि स्थापयितुं "
"शक्यन्ते वा इति टोग्ल् कुर्वन्तु ।</action> पूर्वनिर्धारितं चालू अस्ति । "
"एतत् सेटिङ्ग् एकस्मिन् होस्ट् इत्यत्र परिभाषितं भवेत् यदा<link "
"linkend=\"howtoplay\"> क्रीडन् &amp;i18n-knavalbattle; जालद्वारा</link> ."

#: index.docbook:360
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show End-of-Game "
"Message</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>क्रीडासमाप्तसन्देशं "
"दर्शयतु</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:366
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you won the game and have a new highscore, the highscore dialog will be "
"shown. Otherwise the result is displayed in the statusbar or, if this "
"option is enabled, additionally in a dialog."
msgstr ""
"यदि भवान् क्रीडां जित्वा नूतनः उच्चाङ्कः अस्ति तर्हि उच्चाङ्कसंवादः दर्शितः "
"भविष्यति । अन्यथा परिणामः स्थितिपट्टिकायां अथवा, यदि एषः विकल्पः सक्षमः "
"अस्ति, तर्हि अतिरिक्तरूपेण संवादे प्रदर्शितः भवति ।"

#: index.docbook:374
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Left Grid</guimenuitem> "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Right Grid</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>वामजालं दर्शयतु</guimenuitem> "
"<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>दक्षिणजालं दर्शयतु</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:382
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the grids makes it easier to place a shot with the mouse pointer."
msgstr "जालपुटानां उपयोगेन मूषकसूचकेन सह शॉट् स्थापयितुं सुकरं भवति ।"

#: index.docbook:389
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Difficulty</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guisubmenu>कठिनता</guisubmenu>"

#: index.docbook:395
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game difficulty setting (<guimenuitem>Easy</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Hard</guimenuitem>) has "
"effect only in single player games against the computer. In higher levels "
"the AI uses a smarter strategy for shooting and placing ships."
msgstr ""
"क्रीडाकठिनतासेटिंग् (<guimenuitem>सुलभ</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>मध्यम</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>कठिन</guimenuitem>) केवलं "
"सङ्गणकविरुद्धेषु एकक्रीडकक्रीडासु एव प्रभावं करोति उच्चस्तरस्य एआइ जहाजानां "
"शूटिंग्, स्थापनार्थं च चतुरतरं रणनीतिं प्रयुङ्क्ते ।"

#: index.docbook:404
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &i18n-knavalbattle; has the common &kde; "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for "
"more information read the sections about the <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">Settings Menu</ulink> "
"and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"अतिरिक्तरूपेण &i18n-knavalbattle; सामान्यं &kde; "
"<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> तथा <guimenu>सहायता</guimenu> मेनू-वस्तूनाम्, "
"अधिकसूचनार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">सेटिंग्स् मेन्यू< "
"इत्यस्य विषये विभागान् पठन्तु /ulink> तथा च &kde; मौलिकता।"

